{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a dimly lit, exotic apartment basement in a small, cluttered office. You don\u2019t know what your neighbors are up to. But you want to know everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Network</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Beyond the Doors, your job begins every night right when your neighbors shut their doors<br> and disappear. Place recording devices near their doors. Build a chain to transmit the sound back to your basement office. Collect, analyze, and send these sounds to the people who request information from you each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/57c49f9f5b8de1833eaa0db6ec9f4bd9.poster.avif?t=1771351210\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/57c49f9f5b8de1833eaa0db6ec9f4bd9.webm?t=1771351210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/57c49f9f5b8de1833eaa0db6ec9f4bd9.mp4?t=1771351210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Optimize </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you place more devices, your network will grow more complex. It's up to you to set up the right connections and fix broken network. Use the credits you earn to buy upgrades, merge tangled chains, and build the perfect network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/891e7f063fe6dfd86de082f20b36ba37.poster.avif?t=1771351210\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/891e7f063fe6dfd86de082f20b36ba37.webm?t=1771351210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714150/extras/891e7f063fe6dfd86de082f20b36ba37.mp4?t=1771351210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysterious Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the stairs. Walk the halls. Dig through trash. Sometimes you\u2019ll find random documents or new devices to aid your mission. While doing all this, you may witness some mysterious events. Maybe there is a different universe waiting for you behind the doors you think you can't enter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration of a mysterious and exotic apartment building in a retro 3D environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation-based network building and optimization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management of the economy with a collect-analyze-send loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devices and network upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2714150/0b843412080b5c05c92523702c6e9cd2c5432fb3.jpg"},{"name":"First Connection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2714150/c67635a4e921120a1dde76897b21a97f8d74e747.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2714150/0b843412080b5c05c92523702c6e9cd2c5432fb3.jpg"},{"name":"First Order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2714150/0b843412080b5c05c92523702c6e9cd2c5432fb3.jpg"},{"name":"First Delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2714150/0b843412080b5c05c92523702c6e9cd2c5432fb3.jpg"},{"name":"Shaken",